==Translingual==
===Etymology===
From {{AGr.}} '''{{polytonic|[[ἀμφίβια]]}}''' (amphibia), nominative neuter plural of '''{{polytonic|[[ἀμφίβιος]]}}''' (amphibios) "living two lives" < '''{{polytonic|[[ἀμφί]]}}''' (amphi) "both" + '''{{polytonic|[[βίος]]}}''' (bios) "life"

